<title>UK: ALUMINIUM HOLDS STEADY, OTHER LME METALS END DOWN.</title>
<headline>ALUMINIUM HOLDS STEADY, OTHER LME METALS END DOWN.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Closes steady after re-bounding from lows near $1,730. market in better shape afrter correction.</p>
<p>COPPER - Tails lower during PM, ends near $2,270.</p>
<p>ZINC - Falls back with others, but cushioned by September tightness. LEAD - Holds $600, still easy.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Extends declines, ends weak. TIN - Soft.</p>
</text>
